    {
      "id": "exact-0",
      "kb": "kb",
      "version": "2026-01",
      "text": "背景说明。\nE401 表示令牌失效，必须重新登录。\n附件结束。",
      "sha256": "81b40031b6e0a388cf29849a03aa0ef8c158db5864037b08fd730c583a02726f"
    },
    {
      "id": "paraphrase_query-0",
      "kb": "kb",
      "version": "2026-01",
      "text": "背景说明。\n普通员工在上海住宿，每晚上限为600元。\n附件结束。",
      "sha256": "5ec5f70a232b9774f33458ee0d9c4c70d7fd7c9a269799b3c409d60fd6d3d138"
    },
    {
      "id": "cross_section-0",
      "kb": "kb",
      "version": "2026-01",
      "text": "背景说明。\n登记完成后应按附录乙执行。\n附件结束。",
      "sha256": "da6896c659f87d99301c32ae7686aec63061fa7ddb412405d7e9645cc3a35c6a"
    },
    {
      "id": "cross_section-1",
      "kb": "kb",
      "version": "2026-01",
      "text": "背景说明。\n附录乙要求先断电，再进行密封检查。\n附件结束。",
      "sha256": "f7bb27422bfc3254bedbd38d61330029f2ae49e134088303baaef98f21106898"
    },
    {
      "id": "multihop-0",
      "kb": "kb",
      "version": "2026-01",
      "text": "背景说明。\n甲项目适用乙规范。\n附件结束。",
      "sha256": "4cf36abb142fff2d924e4d9931c100242fa69399e48df0e92ab0044f65144ba1"
    },
    {
      "id": "multihop-1",
      "kb": "kb",
      "version": "2026-01",
      "text": "背景说明。\n乙规范要求使用丙材料。\n附件结束。",
      "sha256": "a976eff35461ee1e1f4ff39d1bb0cc89cbe3410f065a73db44afdbe30d5db015"
    },
    {
      "id": "table-0",
      "kb": "kb",
      "version": "2026-01",
      "text": "背景说明。\n城市|职级|住宿上限（元/晚）\n上海|普通员工|600\n附件结束。",
      "sha256": "302d73e4cb226f1fed171d9de5775e14ac776357184def5291810498b2acb4a4"
    },
    {
      "id": "negation-0",
      "kb": "kb",
      "version": "2026-01",
      "text": "背景说明。\n设备运行时不允许开盖；必须断电后操作。\n附件结束。",
      "sha256": "7a5eea83e653e62710144dd58a3fe6254bc973c9f5d09c14d38e94d841b4e60a"
    },
    {
      "id": "entity-0",
      "kb": "kb",
      "version": "2026-01",
      "text": "背景说明。\n产品A2的额定电压为24伏；产品A1为12伏。\n附件结束。",
      "sha256": "382cfb95e794255724ba006248bf3651518ea75868d747df5ae07f016373369c"
    },
    {
      "id": "version-0",
      "kb": "kb",
      "version": "2026-01",
      "text": "背景说明。\n2026年有效标准：每人每天80元，替代2025年的60元。\n附件结束。",
      "sha256": "edfa8a5b997e3c3aa3033010ce0063d8ea92f05c30de2ec03977c2d4acc117e3"
    },
